---
const { Flow, NodeGraph } = Astro.props.components;
const base = '/architecture';
const journeys = [
  { title: 'Configure & publish', label: 'Control plane', description: 'Define agent models, tools, skills and policies; validate before publishing an immutable version.', path: '/docs/flows/AgentConfigurationLifecycle/0.1.0/' },
  { title: 'Run a selected agent', label: 'Execution', description: 'Trace a user question from authenticated admission through a bounded runtime and streamed answer.', path: '/docs/flows/ExplicitAgentRun/0.1.0/' },
  { title: 'Authorize tools', label: 'Integration', description: 'Understand reviewed MCP, HTTP and job adapters with per-invocation authorization.', path: '/docs/flows/ToolExecution/0.1.0/' },
  { title: 'Triage support email', label: 'Automation', description: 'Use deterministic rules first, economical retrieval when necessary and human-approved drafts.', path: '/docs/flows/SupportEmailIntake/0.1.0/' },
  { title: 'Approve an external job', label: 'Governance', description: 'Follow the immutable approval intent and safe remote-execution/reconciliation path.', path: '/docs/flows/ApprovalGatedExternalJob/0.1.0/' },
  { title: 'Delegate to a specialist', label: 'Multi-agent', description: 'Follow a bounded child run with explicit subagent bindings, reserved budget and audit lineage.', path: '/docs/flows/DelegatedAgentRun/0.1.0/' },
];
---
<main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-8 sm:px-8 sm:py-12">
  <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-6 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 sm:p-10">
    <p class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300">Architecture reference · Proposed</p>
    <h1 class="mb-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">Configurable agents, explained from configuration to execution.</h1>
    <p class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
      Follow the actual responsibilities behind an agent platform: versioned definitions, intelligent but constrained routing,
      durable runs, model and tool boundaries, human approvals, and safe delegation.
      The examples are fictional and document a proposed architecture—not deployed production services.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a class="rounded-lg bg-slate-900 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-slate-700 dark:bg-sky-500 dark:text-slate-950" href={base + '/domains/AgentPlatform/0.1.0/'}>Explore the full domain</a>
      <a class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 hover:bg-white dark:border-slate-600 dark:text-slate-100 dark:hover:bg-slate-800" href={base + '/visualiser/system-context-map/'}>Open system context map</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-10">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Choose an architecture journey</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Every journey is a native EventCatalog Flow connected to services, commands, events and schemas.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {journeys.map((journey) => (
        <a class="group rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 transition hover:border-sky-400 hover:shadow-sm dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900" href={base + journey.path}>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300">{journey.label}</span>
          <h3 class="mt-2 text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-sky-700 dark:text-white">{journey.title} →</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">{journey.description}</p>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid gap-7 py-4 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5 dark:border-slate-700">
      <div class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Platform relationship map</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Start from the domain and select a service or agent to explore ownership.</p>
      </div>
      <NodeGraph id="AgentPlatform" version="0.1.0" type="domain" />
    </div>
    <div class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-5 dark:border-slate-700">
      <div class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Follow a live architecture flow</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">A selected agent run, with reviewable service and event nodes.</p>
      </div>
      <Flow id="ExplicitAgentRun" version="0.1.0" includeKey={false} />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 dark:border-slate-700 dark:bg-slate-900 sm:p-7">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Architecture decisions & API contracts</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">These choices are still <strong>proposals</strong>. Review alternatives and affected resources before treating an option as approved.</p>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2">
      <a class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4 hover:border-sky-400 dark:border-slate-700" href={base + '/docs/adrs/adr-001-workflow-engine/0.1.0/'}>ADR-001 · Durable execution boundary →</a>
      <a class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4 hover:border-sky-400 dark:border-slate-700" href={base + '/docs/adrs/adr-002-runtime-adapter/0.1.0/'}>ADR-002 · Pluggable runtime →</a>
      <a class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4 hover:border-sky-400 dark:border-slate-700" href={base + '/docs/adrs/adr-003-tool-security/0.1.0/'}>ADR-003 · Reviewed tool execution →</a>
      <a class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-4 hover:border-sky-400 dark:border-slate-700" href={base + '/docs/adrs/adr-004-agent-routing/0.1.0/'}>ADR-004 · Bounded routing →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">The <a href={base + '/docs/services/PlatformAPI/0.1.0/'} class="font-semibold text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300">Platform API</a> links to proposed OpenAPI 3.1 documentation; the <a href={base + '/docs/services/RunService/0.1.0/'} class="font-semibold text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300">Run Service</a> links to proposed AsyncAPI 3 event contracts. Service owners are provisional, and an accepted architecture decision is not the same as an implemented service.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="my-10 border-t border-slate-200 pt-8 dark:border-slate-700">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Design rules you can verify</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Pinned, durable execution</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Admit a run only after saving its identity, immutable agent version and dispatch intent.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Reviewed side effects</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">The model proposes a tool; the gateway authorizes it. Writes may require approval and reconciliation.</p></div>
      <div><h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Bounded cost & privileges</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Policies restrict turns, tokens, tools, child agents, time and spend independently of prompts.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">For deeper details, browse the <a href={base + '/domains/AgentPlatform/0.1.0/'} class="font-semibold text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300">domain model</a> or the <a class="font-semibold text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300" href="https://github.com/buianhtai/buianhtai.github.io/tree/main/docs/agent-platform">architecture chapters on GitHub</a>.</p>
  </section>
</main>
